# Debian base-image (python:3.12-slim) OS-package CVEs with no upstream fix
# available as of 2026-07-05. All are in packages this headless FastAPI/ML
# service never exercises (no shell scripts, no terminal UI, no ad-hoc
# archive extraction) — perl/gzip/ncurses/acl ship as part of Debian's
# minimal base system, not as app dependencies. Re-run a clean Trivy scan
# periodically and drop entries once Debian ships real fixes.

# gzip: buffer overflow in LZH decompression — not invoked by this service
CVE-2026-41992

# libacl1: symlink traversal privilege escalation via libacl functions — not used
CVE-2026-54369

# libncursesw6 / libtinfo6 / ncurses-base / ncurses-bin: buffer overflow —
# no terminal UI in a headless service
CVE-2025-69720

# perl-base: path traversal / heap overflow / arbitrary file access / DoS via
# perl-Archive-Tar and perl-IO-Compress — perl is not invoked by this service
CVE-2026-42496
CVE-2026-8376
CVE-2026-42497
CVE-2026-48962
CVE-2026-9538
